1
00:00:00,478 --> 00:00:03,652
Reach your hands out,

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:06,913
cut through the wind,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,130
and forge ahead, drawing your own map as you go!

4
00:00:16,435 --> 00:00:19,565
We can't even tell left from right

5
00:00:19,608 --> 00:00:22,782
in this tempest-tossed era

6
00:00:22,869 --> 00:00:26,043
Even the values we've honed

7
00:00:26,043 --> 00:00:29,390
seem ready to crumble

8
00:00:29,391 --> 00:00:32,652
Is the compass leading us true,

9
00:00:32,696 --> 00:00:35,869
or is it leading us astray?

10
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:39,217
Nobody knows for sure!

11
00:00:39,217 --> 00:00:45,652
Just breathe deep, close your eyes

12
00:00:45,739 --> 00:00:52,696
and you'll find your soul guiding the way!

13
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,913
Reach your hands out,

14
00:00:55,913 --> 00:00:59,174
cut through the wind,

15
00:00:59,174 --> 00:01:04,043
and kick away the darkness!

16
00:01:05,086 --> 00:01:08,129
I'm doing this for myself,

17
00:01:08,130 --> 00:01:12,260
and you're doing this for yourself too, right?

18
00:01:12,347 --> 00:01:17,347
Forge ahead, painting the world in your own colors!

19
00:02:05,913 --> 00:02:08,391
King has just met his defeat.

20
00:02:08,391 --> 00:02:10,217
What, now?
Are you certain?

21
00:02:10,652 --> 00:02:13,869
The All-Stars and
the Flying Six, annihilated...

22
00:02:14,478 --> 00:02:16,608
This is most serious.

23
00:02:21,304 --> 00:02:22,695
Of course,

24
00:02:23,304 --> 00:02:29,130
two monsters yet remain, both capable of
rendering the Straw Hats' heroics...

25
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,783
Blast Breath!

26
00:02:35,217 --> 00:02:36,913
...utterly meaningless.

27
00:02:38,174 --> 00:02:41,782
The battle between Luffy and Kaido
hits peak intensity.

28
00:02:42,304 --> 00:02:46,564
However, there is another side
to this decisive battle!

29
00:02:46,565 --> 00:02:49,565
Luffy's victory over Kaido
will cause...

30
00:02:49,565 --> 00:02:51,043
...the Flame Clouds to dissipate.

31
00:02:59,521 --> 00:03:01,434
Onigashima will crash,

32
00:03:01,435 --> 00:03:05,043
and the gunpowder in its lowest level
will detonate the Flower Capital!

33
00:03:07,130 --> 00:03:09,521
Tens of thousands of
unwitting attendees...

34
00:03:09,521 --> 00:03:12,825
...enjoying the Fire Festival will perish!

35
00:03:16,043 --> 00:03:20,869
I will not let the island reach the Flower Capital,
come what may!

36
00:03:23,347 --> 00:03:25,304
To the abyss...

37
00:03:28,347 --> 00:03:30,390
To the abyss...

38
00:03:30,391 --> 00:03:33,130
And then there's the second crisis:

39
00:03:33,130 --> 00:03:36,695
Kanjuro's burning grudge,
planted by Orochi,

40
00:03:36,696 --> 00:03:40,609
...moves toward Onigashima's lowest level,
intent on causing a midair explosion.

41
00:03:42,957 --> 00:03:44,826
Yamato is in pursuit!

42
00:03:46,869 --> 00:03:48,130
I knew it!

43
00:03:51,608 --> 00:03:53,912
Rokki is obstructing the doors
to the basement!

44
00:03:54,869 --> 00:03:57,391
I haven't the time to take him down,

45
00:03:57,391 --> 00:04:00,826
obtain the key
and pull the lever to open the doors!

46
00:04:02,608 --> 00:04:03,912
If you would, Fuga!

47
00:04:20,652 --> 00:04:22,304
Hurray!

48
00:04:22,347 --> 00:04:24,043
Thank you, Fuga!

49
00:04:26,217 --> 00:04:28,391
Keep Rokki occupied!

50
00:04:39,130 --> 00:04:40,956
These wounds're serious...

51
00:04:43,217 --> 00:04:45,174
My body is whole once again...

52
00:04:45,174 --> 00:04:47,652
H-How does your body even work?!

53
00:04:47,652 --> 00:04:49,435
Anyway, you two...

54
00:04:49,435 --> 00:04:52,217
We've gotta get you both to Chopper
for treatment ASAP!

55
00:04:53,304 --> 00:04:54,521
There they are!

56
00:04:54,565 --> 00:04:56,782
Don't let the Straw Hats get away!

57
00:04:56,782 --> 00:04:57,782
Let's go!

58
00:04:57,782 --> 00:04:59,086
Make 'em dead!

59
00:04:59,086 --> 00:05:02,738
Why the hell did they have
to get here now?!

60
00:05:10,913 --> 00:05:13,043
Exploding Skull Grass!

61
00:05:17,347 --> 00:05:20,043
Check it out!
That guy's worth 200 million!

62
00:05:20,043 --> 00:05:21,564
Don't let him leave alive!

63
00:05:22,217 --> 00:05:24,478
I'm screwed!
I'm dead meat!

64
00:05:24,478 --> 00:05:26,782
I'm surrounded by
the flames and bad guys!

65
00:05:26,826 --> 00:05:28,956
U-Usopp-dono...

66
00:05:28,957 --> 00:05:32,000
Leave me...
Help Kiku...!

67
00:05:33,957 --> 00:05:36,521
No, Kin-sama...

68
00:05:36,521 --> 00:05:38,825
I am beyond saving...

69
00:05:38,869 --> 00:05:41,869
Suuure! I'm gonna leave you both here
and save my own skin!

70
00:05:41,869 --> 00:05:46,391
The hell's the point of me coming here then,
you suicidal samufreaks?!

71
00:05:54,521 --> 00:05:58,912
Dying with honor?!
Cutting yourself open out of responsibility?!

72
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:02,956
I'm not into your culture!

73
00:06:03,304 --> 00:06:06,869
I'll cling to life with snot running
from my nose, if I have to!

74
00:06:06,869 --> 00:06:09,782
I'll go on living,
no matter how bad I look!

75
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,696
I survived all that,
and that's why I'm still kicking!

76
00:06:19,391 --> 00:06:21,565
Usopp-dono!

77
00:06:21,565 --> 00:06:25,738
Why are you idiots so satisfied
with just pulling off your raid?!

78
00:06:28,826 --> 00:06:30,608
Nopenopenopenopenope!

79
00:06:33,739 --> 00:06:35,087
He's right!

80
00:06:36,174 --> 00:06:37,000
Get down!

81
00:06:54,347 --> 00:06:56,695
Hey, what the hell's he doing here!?

82
00:06:56,696 --> 00:06:59,478
A former commander
of the Whitebeard Pirates,

83
00:06:59,478 --> 00:07:01,347
Izo!

84
00:07:01,347 --> 00:07:04,043
Marco was on the
Performance Floor, too..

85
00:07:04,043 --> 00:07:05,129
What's going on?!

86
00:07:06,174 --> 00:07:08,130
Thanks, whoever you are!

87
00:07:08,782 --> 00:07:09,912
Izo...

88
00:07:17,913 --> 00:07:20,261
Big Brother...
I...

89
00:07:21,174 --> 00:07:24,130
No speaking.
'Tis bad for your wounds.

90
00:07:24,478 --> 00:07:28,435
We can exchange stories to our hearts' content
after the battle is done.

91
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,217
But...

92
00:07:31,043 --> 00:07:32,695
...I do not believe I can...

93
00:07:33,086 --> 00:07:36,043
As your brother,
I forbid you to give in.

94
00:07:39,391 --> 00:07:40,435
Aye?

95
00:07:41,304 --> 00:07:42,390
Aye.

96
00:07:44,086 --> 00:07:47,043
I shall rescue you both,
whatever the cost!

97
00:07:48,869 --> 00:07:49,782
That is why...

98
00:07:52,391 --> 00:07:53,478
...you must live!

99
00:07:58,608 --> 00:08:03,521
That is, if you truly believe
in Straw Hat Luffy!

100
00:08:04,217 --> 00:08:05,260
Aye!

101
00:08:05,826 --> 00:08:06,652
Mm!

102
00:08:07,608 --> 00:08:10,304
And you, Big Brother, must also...

103
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,000
...live!

104
00:08:28,565 --> 00:08:30,086
God Usopp!

105
00:08:30,086 --> 00:08:32,260
Huuuh?!
You know me?!

106
00:08:34,739 --> 00:08:36,696
Of course!
You are the Sniper King!

107
00:08:36,696 --> 00:08:38,130
Shucks!

108
00:08:38,478 --> 00:08:39,869
Take care of those two!

109
00:08:39,869 --> 00:08:41,043
You got it!

110
00:08:46,478 --> 00:08:47,565
Hamlet!

111
00:08:47,565 --> 00:08:48,260
Aye!

112
00:08:48,260 --> 00:08:49,086
Let's move!

113
00:08:49,086 --> 00:08:52,738
"Departure"! That means
we're setting out on a new journey!

114
00:08:52,739 --> 00:08:54,478
You're not getting away!

115
00:08:56,739 --> 00:08:59,435
None shall pass this point!

116
00:09:18,652 --> 00:09:22,261
The battle is ended!
You caught fire first!

117
00:09:24,435 --> 00:09:27,608
Undo your Paralysis Technique, Raizo!

118
00:09:29,174 --> 00:09:32,434
After you, Fukurokuju!

119
00:09:32,435 --> 00:09:35,086
If that is what you wish,
then so be it!

120
00:09:35,086 --> 00:09:37,347
How unfortunate for you!

121
00:09:37,347 --> 00:09:40,217
Your death will undo your technique!

122
00:09:40,217 --> 00:09:42,652
I am a retainer of Oden-sama!

123
00:09:42,652 --> 00:09:45,478
I feel no heat from this puny spark!

124
00:09:53,478 --> 00:09:56,260
Is this a dream, or is this reality?

125
00:09:56,260 --> 00:09:59,869
I can scarely believe Komurasaki,
who I took for dead,

126
00:09:59,869 --> 00:10:02,260
is at my side, playing the shamisen!

127
00:10:02,260 --> 00:10:04,608
You're late, Fukurokuju!

128
00:10:04,608 --> 00:10:08,130
We have to make our escape
before the island explodes!

129
00:10:10,086 --> 00:10:12,564
My Lord, what is the mattter?

130
00:10:13,260 --> 00:10:15,217
Oh, no... Nothing...

131
00:10:15,217 --> 00:10:18,782
know, Komurasaki!
Play that piece for me!

132
00:10:18,869 --> 00:10:23,304
The song I love,
the one you used to play for me!

133
00:10:23,347 --> 00:10:25,608
Yes, of course!

134
00:10:37,130 --> 00:10:38,087
Drake!

135
00:10:41,913 --> 00:10:43,783
We're outta here, Inbi!

136
00:10:46,347 --> 00:10:49,695
We don't gotta get mixed up
with those freaks!

137
00:10:51,608 --> 00:10:54,434
Sorry, Zanki!
Later, Drake!

138
00:11:01,782 --> 00:11:03,391
How troublesome...

139
00:11:05,347 --> 00:11:06,738
Still, that was to be expected.

140
00:11:07,565 --> 00:11:09,217
Apoo ran away...

141
00:11:09,217 --> 00:11:12,869
Ring, ring, ring...
Ring, ring, ring...

142
00:11:12,869 --> 00:11:13,869
Clik.

143
00:11:13,869 --> 00:11:16,043
Have you apprehended Nico Robin?

144
00:11:16,043 --> 00:11:18,434
Not yet.
We were interrupted.

145
00:11:18,435 --> 00:11:19,652
Hurry, then.

146
00:11:19,652 --> 00:11:21,609
We must make our way
out of this castle.

147
00:11:21,957 --> 00:11:23,913
The All-Stars suffered
a crushing defeat!

148
00:11:24,869 --> 00:11:26,652
That's impossible!

149
00:11:31,086 --> 00:11:37,129
If the new generation were to
somehow claim victory,

150
00:11:37,217 --> 00:11:39,174
it would make headlines.

151
00:11:44,913 --> 00:11:49,260
And it would then serve
as a tailwind...

152
00:11:49,260 --> 00:11:52,390
...for current events
around the world right now.

153
00:11:53,174 --> 00:11:58,826
What happens in the next few minutes
will set the course for the coming era!

154
00:11:58,826 --> 00:12:00,695
That may well be, but...

155
00:12:02,478 --> 00:12:03,652
...don't you think they've...

156
00:12:06,696 --> 00:12:09,565
...already hit the limit of what
human beings can achieve?

157
00:12:29,217 --> 00:12:30,695
Gum-Gum...

158
00:12:51,217 --> 00:12:53,260
Gum-Gum...

159
00:13:24,869 --> 00:13:26,173
Gear 3!

160
00:13:39,347 --> 00:13:42,260
Gum-Gum...

161
00:13:47,217 --> 00:13:50,086
I'm sick of hearing "Gum-Gum❞

162
00:13:50,086 --> 00:13:52,956
Roc Gun!

163
00:14:35,652 --> 00:14:37,869
Now I'm havin' fun!

164
00:14:40,696 --> 00:14:42,391
So am I!

165
00:14:57,478 --> 00:14:59,174
That hit the spot!

166
00:14:59,174 --> 00:15:02,130
Moderation, man!
You've had too much to drink!

167
00:15:02,130 --> 00:15:03,695
Dumbassh!

168
00:15:03,739 --> 00:15:07,217
's the only day of the year
we get to drink!

169
00:15:07,217 --> 00:15:12,087
Every other day's just misery,
livin' here in this country...

170
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:14,565
Hey, Orochi!

171
00:15:14,565 --> 00:15:15,086
You shi-

172
00:15:15,086 --> 00:15:16,782
Hey, knock it off,
knock it off!

173
00:15:18,086 --> 00:15:20,347
Public officials can be anywhere...

174
00:15:20,521 --> 00:15:21,695
Look over there...

175
00:15:22,608 --> 00:15:27,695
They've started preppin' the sky lantern boats...
Guess the festival's comin' to an end.

176
00:15:33,565 --> 00:15:35,173
That's a lotta lanterns!

177
00:15:45,913 --> 00:15:50,739
Go on, write a wish
to send to your ancestors.

178
00:15:50,739 --> 00:15:52,478
What should I wish for?

179
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:56,435
Why don't you write your wish, too?

180
00:15:57,435 --> 00:15:59,782
Will my wish come true?

181
00:16:00,260 --> 00:16:01,521
Mm-hmm.

182
00:16:01,521 --> 00:16:06,043
Your ancestors in heaven
will discover your sky lantern boat,

183
00:16:06,043 --> 00:16:08,738
and surely grant your wish then.

184
00:16:11,304 --> 00:16:13,260
Will Daddy read it?

185
00:16:14,174 --> 00:16:16,130
He certainly will!

186
00:16:33,391 --> 00:16:36,217
Why the hell're ya drinkin'?!

187
00:16:38,608 --> 00:16:40,478
Cause I'm having fun!

188
00:16:41,696 --> 00:16:44,739
They're havin' the Fire Festival
today in the capital.

189
00:16:44,739 --> 00:16:48,130
We were supposed to have a huge feast
here on Onigashima, too.

190
00:16:48,130 --> 00:16:51,652
But your bunch went and crashed the party,
made a mess of it all...

191
00:16:52,217 --> 00:16:54,217
Ya want some o' this?

192
00:16:54,652 --> 00:16:57,174
Ya look like
you're enjoying yourself...

193
00:16:57,217 --> 00:16:59,347
Drunk off your ass?!

194
00:17:00,652 --> 00:17:05,304
As if I'd get drunk
offa this little bit o' swill!

195
00:17:07,174 --> 00:17:09,913
My great feast...

196
00:17:09,913 --> 00:17:14,870
You totally wrecked my party...

197
00:17:27,304 --> 00:17:29,521
You're totally drunk!

198
00:17:32,217 --> 00:17:34,043
Straw Hat!

199
00:17:38,608 --> 00:17:40,869
What the hell're ya doin'?!

200
00:17:43,696 --> 00:17:45,956
Can you really fight like that?!

201
00:17:46,608 --> 00:17:50,565
If ya lose, I don't wanna hear excuses like
"I was drunk"!

202
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:57,564
Ya duuumbass!

203
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:06,130
Why would I wanna
make myself weaker?

204
00:18:06,913 --> 00:18:09,478
Take it as a sign that
I've accepted ya!

205
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,087
Gum-Gum...

206
00:18:22,826 --> 00:18:25,782
Drunken Dragon Bagua!

207
00:18:26,391 --> 00:18:27,087
Wha?!

208
00:18:28,608 --> 00:18:30,956
I'm feelin' real good now!

209
00:18:31,347 --> 00:18:38,651
When was the last time I met somebody
who could really go toe-to-toe with me?

210
00:18:50,739 --> 00:18:53,478
Lightning Hammered...

211
00:18:55,435 --> 00:18:57,782
Ragnaraku!

212
00:19:32,217 --> 00:19:36,869
This place is useless to me...

213
00:19:39,217 --> 00:19:41,521
The island's a total junkyard...

214
00:19:41,869 --> 00:19:45,912
It's fun, but at the same time,
the castle's half destroyed.

215
00:19:46,391 --> 00:19:51,174
Dammit...
Can't even defend my own castle...

216
00:19:51,869 --> 00:19:53,999
Guess I don't got it anymore...

217
00:19:54,608 --> 00:19:55,825
Whatever it is...

218
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:59,000
Gotta rebuild...

219
00:19:59,957 --> 00:20:04,261
It took five years to build, dammit!

220
00:20:12,174 --> 00:20:14,043
I felt that!

221
00:20:14,043 --> 00:20:15,782
That son of a...!

222
00:20:16,130 --> 00:20:17,782
Dammit...

223
00:20:19,826 --> 00:20:21,695
Are ya actually drunk?!

224
00:20:25,304 --> 00:20:29,217
I sold weapons here and there,

225
00:20:29,217 --> 00:20:33,260
and even formed
the world's strongest army usin' Smiles...

226
00:20:33,869 --> 00:20:37,217
I did everything I could!

227
00:20:40,608 --> 00:20:43,130
Lettin' my guard down like that...

228
00:20:43,130 --> 00:20:44,521
I'm such a moron!

229
00:20:46,608 --> 00:20:50,304
But maybe I can't do this anymore...

230
00:20:54,696 --> 00:20:58,782
I want it all gooooone!

231
00:21:00,478 --> 00:21:03,782
Dragon Twister Demolition Breath!

232
00:21:13,652 --> 00:21:15,739
That jackass is outta control!

233
00:21:18,521 --> 00:21:23,086
Just leave me alone,
I'm beggin' ya!

234
00:21:26,347 --> 00:21:27,695
The hell're ya on about?!

235
00:21:27,696 --> 00:21:29,608
I'm so ashamed...
I regret everything!

236
00:21:29,608 --> 00:21:33,304
I'm doomed!
I... I...

237
00:21:49,304 --> 00:21:51,434
Leave me alone,

238
00:21:51,435 --> 00:21:54,043
you stupid dumbass!

239
00:21:55,696 --> 00:21:57,348
He's really throwin' me off!

240
00:21:59,696 --> 00:22:01,522
Whining hour's been over!

241
00:22:03,869 --> 00:22:07,912
If yer not gonna go away,
I'mma make you!

242
00:22:08,000 --> 00:22:09,913
Thunder...

243
00:22:10,521 --> 00:22:11,782
...Bagua!

244
00:22:21,086 --> 00:22:23,347
Swallow this, you drunk ass!

245
00:23:01,739 --> 00:23:03,826
His Haki's getting stronger!

246
00:23:05,913 --> 00:23:08,304
Just when I'm finally
good and drunk...

247
00:23:10,739 --> 00:23:14,130
Stop tryin' to sober me up!

248
00:23:36,086 --> 00:23:38,869
Gum-Gum

249
00:23:40,565 --> 00:23:43,043
Kundali...

250
00:23:43,696 --> 00:23:46,261
Roc Gatling!

251
00:23:46,347 --> 00:23:49,173
...Dragon Swarm!

252
00:24:51,043 --> 00:24:54,782
This year's Reverie is cursed.

253
00:24:55,913 --> 00:24:58,652
The total abolition of
the Seven Warlords of the Sea...

254
00:24:59,347 --> 00:25:02,086
The incident concerning
the Kingdom of Alabasta...

255
00:25:02,608 --> 00:25:05,782
The Revolutionary Army's
infiltration of Mary Geoise...

256
00:25:06,174 --> 00:25:08,304
Let us table those issues
for the moment.

257
00:25:09,826 --> 00:25:12,869
Our immediate concern
is the Land of Wano.

258
00:25:12,869 --> 00:25:17,217
Who would have imagined
the battle reaching such intensity?

259
00:25:17,217 --> 00:25:19,391
The time to act is now.

260
00:25:20,174 --> 00:25:23,391
Surely Nico Robin is
in our custody at this very moment...

261
00:25:24,130 --> 00:25:26,913
In a battle against Kaido and Big Mom,

262
00:25:27,217 --> 00:25:30,217
casualties are... inevitable.

263
00:25:30,217 --> 00:25:32,174
She must be erased!

264
00:25:32,174 --> 00:25:37,565
As must the existence of
that Devil Fruit.

265
00:25:44,565 --> 00:25:47,391
Maintain combat readiness
until further notice.

266
00:25:47,391 --> 00:25:49,652
All ships, remain on standby.

267
00:26:05,652 --> 00:26:07,260
Sir...

268
00:26:07,260 --> 00:26:08,217
Situation report?

269
00:26:09,130 --> 00:26:13,130
Well...
There's this giant shadow...

270
00:26:13,130 --> 00:26:15,695
A shadow?
Of what?

271
00:26:16,435 --> 00:26:17,739
Unknown...

272
00:26:19,130 --> 00:26:20,782
What the hell
do you mean by that?

273
00:26:21,435 --> 00:26:23,782
A-An island...?

274
00:26:24,521 --> 00:26:26,608
No, that's impossible!

275
00:26:26,608 --> 00:26:31,260
Even to us, that fruit is but a legend!

276
00:26:33,565 --> 00:26:37,565
It hasn't awakened for centuries.

277
00:26:37,913 --> 00:26:40,347
Then, why would
the World Government...

278
00:26:40,347 --> 00:26:44,521
...deign to give that Devil Fruit
another name?!

279
00:26:53,174 --> 00:26:57,217
To strike its name from history,
of course!